{"k":"bin","t":"Binomial Theorem","cls":"11","u":"Algebra","s":[["Expansion",[{"q":"Binomial theorem","f":"(x+a)^n=\\sum_{r=0}^{n}{}^nC_r\\,x^{n-r}a^r","n":"$n+1$ terms, $n\\in\\mathbb N$.","d":"Induction: assume for $n$, multiply by $(x+a)$, and use ${}^nC_r+{}^nC_{r-1}={}^{n+1}C_r$."},{"q":"General term","f":"T_{r+1}={}^nC_r\\,x^{n-r}a^r"},{"q":"Middle term(s)","f":"n\\ \\text{even}:\\ T_{\\frac n2+1};\\qquad n\\ \\text{odd}:\\ T_{\\frac{n+1}2},\\ T_{\\frac{n+3}2}"},{"q":"Term independent of $x$ in $\\left(x^\\alpha+\\frac1{x^\\beta}\\right)^n$","f":"\\alpha(n-r)-\\beta r=0\\ \\Rightarrow\\ r=\\frac{\\alpha n}{\\alpha+\\beta}"},{"q":"Numerically greatest term in $(1+x)^n$","f":"\\frac{T_{r+1}}{T_r}=\\frac{n-r+1}{r}|x|\\ge1\\iff r\\le\\frac{(n+1)|x|}{1+|x|}","n":"If $m=\\frac{(n+1)|x|}{1+|x|}$ is an integer, $T_m$ and $T_{m+1}$ are equal and greatest; else $T_{[m]+1}$."},{"q":"Number of terms in a multinomial expansion","f":"(x_1+\\cdots+x_r)^n:\\ {}^{n+r-1}C_{r-1}\\ \\text{terms}"},{"q":"Multinomial coefficient","f":"(x_1+\\cdots+x_k)^n=\\sum\\frac{n!}{n_1!\\cdots n_k!}x_1^{n_1}\\cdots x_k^{n_k},\\quad\\sum n_i=n"},{"q":"$(x-a)^n$ expansion","f":"(x-a)^n=\\sum_{r=0}^n(-1)^r\\,{}^nC_r\\,x^{n-r}a^r"},{"q":"Number of terms in $(x+a)^n+(x-a)^n$ and $(x+a)^n-(x-a)^n$","f":"n\\ \\text{even}:\\ \\tfrac n2+1\\ \\text{and}\\ \\tfrac n2;\\qquad n\\ \\text{odd}:\\ \\tfrac{n+1}2\\ \\text{each}"},{"q":"$(x+a)^n+(x-a)^n$","f":"2\\left[{}^nC_0x^n+{}^nC_2x^{n-2}a^2+\\cdots\\right]"},{"q":"$r$-th term from the end","f":"T_r\\ \\text{from end}=T_{n-r+2}\\ \\text{from beginning}"},{"q":"Greatest coefficient","f":"n\\ \\text{even}:\\ {}^nC_{n/2};\\qquad n\\ \\text{odd}:\\ {}^nC_{(n\\pm1)/2}"},{"q":"Coefficient of $x^k$ in $(1+x)^m(1+x)^n$ type products","f":"\\sum_r(\\text{coeff of } x^r\\text{ in first})(\\text{coeff of } x^{k-r}\\text{ in second})"},{"q":"Coefficient of $x^r$ in $(1+x+x^2+\\cdots+x^n)$-type products","f":"\\text{use } \\frac{1-x^{n+1}}{1-x}\\ \\text{and expand } (1-x)^{-k}"},{"q":"Ratio of consecutive coefficients","f":"\\frac{{}^nC_r}{{}^nC_{r-1}}=\\frac{n-r+1}r","n":"Three consecutive coefficients in ratio $a:b:c$ → two equations in $n$, $r$."}]],["Sums of coefficients",[{"q":"Sum of all binomial coefficients","f":"C_0+C_1+\\cdots+C_n=2^n","d":"Put $x=1$ in $(1+x)^n=\\sum C_rx^r$."},{"q":"Alternate sums","f":"C_0+C_2+C_4+\\cdots=C_1+C_3+\\cdots=2^{n-1}","d":"Put $x=-1$: $\\sum(-1)^rC_r=0$; combine with the total $2^n$."},{"q":"Weighted sum $\\sum rC_r$","f":"\\sum_{r=0}^n r\\,C_r=n2^{n-1},\\qquad\\sum r^2C_r=n(n+1)2^{n-2}","d":"Differentiate $(1+x)^n$ and put $x=1$."},{"q":"Sum $\\sum\\frac{C_r}{r+1}$","f":"\\sum_{r=0}^n\\frac{C_r}{r+1}=\\frac{2^{n+1}-1}{n+1}","d":"Integrate $(1+x)^n$ from $0$ to $1$."},{"q":"Alternating version","f":"\\sum_{r=0}^n\\frac{(-1)^rC_r}{r+1}=\\frac1{n+1}"},{"q":"Vandermonde's identity","f":"\\sum_{r}{}^mC_r\\,{}^nC_{k-r}={}^{m+n}C_k","n":"Special: $C_0^2+C_1^2+\\cdots+C_n^2={}^{2n}C_n$.","d":"Compare coefficient of $x^k$ in $(1+x)^m(1+x)^n=(1+x)^{m+n}$."},{"q":"Product sum $\\sum C_rC_{r+k}$","f":"C_0C_k+C_1C_{k+1}+\\cdots+C_{n-k}C_n={}^{2n}C_{n-k}"},{"q":"Alternating squares","f":"C_0^2-C_1^2+C_2^2-\\cdots=\\begin{cases}0,&n\\ \\text{odd}\\\\(-1)^{n/2}\\,{}^nC_{n/2},&n\\ \\text{even}\\end{cases}"},{"q":"Sum of coefficients of a polynomial","f":"f(1);\\qquad\\text{even-power coefficients}=\\frac{f(1)+f(-1)}2"},{"q":"$\\sum(r+1)C_r$","f":"\\sum_{r=0}^n(r+1){}^nC_r=(n+2)2^{n-1}"},{"q":"$\\sum(-1)^rrC_r$","f":"\\sum_{r=0}^n(-1)^r\\,r\\,{}^nC_r=0\\quad(n\\ge2)"},{"q":"$\\sum\\frac{C_r}{r+2}$ and $\\sum\\frac{C_r}{(r+1)(r+2)}$","f":"\\sum_{r=0}^n\\frac{{}^nC_r}{(r+1)(r+2)}=\\frac{2^{n+2}-n-3}{(n+1)(n+2)}"},{"q":"$\\sum r\\,C_r^2$","f":"\\sum_{r=0}^nr\\left({}^nC_r\\right)^2=n\\,{}^{2n-1}C_{n-1}"},{"q":"$\\sum C_{3r}$ (every third coefficient)","f":"C_0+C_3+C_6+\\cdots=\\frac13\\left(2^n+2\\cos\\frac{n\\pi}3\\right)"},{"q":"Sum $\\sum_{r}{}^{r}C_k$ over upper index","f":"{}^kC_k+{}^{k+1}C_k+\\cdots+{}^nC_k={}^{n+1}C_{k+1}"},{"q":"Sum of coefficients in $(ax+by)^n$","f":"(a+b)^n"},{"q":"Product of binomial coefficients","f":"C_0C_1\\cdots C_n,\\qquad\\frac{C_1}{C_0}+2\\frac{C_2}{C_1}+\\cdots+n\\frac{C_n}{C_{n-1}}=\\frac{n(n+1)}2"}]],["General index",[{"q":"Binomial theorem for any index","f":"(1+x)^n=1+nx+\\frac{n(n-1)}{2!}x^2+\\cdots,\\quad|x|<1","n":"General term $\\frac{n(n-1)\\cdots(n-r+1)}{r!}x^r$."},{"q":"Standard expansions","f":"(1-x)^{-1}=\\sum x^r,\\quad(1-x)^{-2}=\\sum(r+1)x^r,\\quad(1-x)^{-n}=\\sum{}^{n+r-1}C_r\\,x^r"},{"q":"Approximation for small $x$","f":"(1+x)^n\\approx1+nx"},{"q":"Expansions to remember","f":"(1+x)^{-1}=1-x+x^2-\\cdots,\\quad(1+x)^{-2}=1-2x+3x^2-\\cdots,\\quad(1-x)^{-3}=\\sum\\frac{(r+1)(r+2)}2x^r"},{"q":"$\\sqrt{1+x}$ and $\\frac1{\\sqrt{1-4x}}$","f":"\\sqrt{1+x}=1+\\frac x2-\\frac{x^2}8+\\frac{x^3}{16}-\\cdots,\\qquad\\frac1{\\sqrt{1-4x}}=\\sum{}^{2r}C_r\\,x^r"},{"q":"Coefficient of $x^r$ in $(1-x)^{-n}$","f":"{}^{n+r-1}C_r"}]],["Common results",[{"q":"Divisibility / remainder trick","f":"(1+a)^n=1+na+\\binom n2a^2+\\cdots\\ \\Rightarrow\\ (1+a)^n\\equiv1+na\\pmod{a^2}","n":"E.g. $7^{2n}=49^n=(1+48)^n$."},{"q":"Integral and fractional part trick","f":"(\\sqrt a+b)^n=I+f,\\ \\ (\\sqrt a-b)^n=f'\\ (0<f'<1):\\ \\ I+f\\pm f'\\ \\text{is an integer}","n":"If $n$ is odd and $\\sqrt a-b>0$, $f=f'$; then $(I+f)f=(a-b^2)^n$."},{"q":"Last digits","f":"\\text{use } (10k\\pm1)^n\\ \\text{expansion modulo } 10, 100"},{"q":"Remainder of $a^n$ divided by $b$","f":"\\text{write } a^n=(kb\\pm1)^m\\cdot\\ldots,\\ \\text{expand, keep the last terms}"},{"q":"Comparing large numbers","f":"(1.01)^{1000000}\\ \\text{vs } 10000:\\ \\text{use } (1+x)^n>1+nx"},{"q":"Number of rational terms in $(a^{1/p}+b^{1/q})^n$","f":"\\text{count } r\\ (0\\le r\\le n)\\ \\text{with } p\\mid(n-r)\\ \\text{and } q\\mid r"},{"q":"Last two digits of $3^{400}$ type","f":"3^{400}=(10-1)^{200}\\equiv1\\pmod{100}"}]],["If this type comes, solve like this",[{"q":"If it asks the term independent of $x$ / a given power of $x$","f":"T_{r+1}={}^nC_r\\,(\\text{first})^{n-r}(\\text{second})^r;\\ \\ \\text{set the power of } x\\text{ equal to the target}","n":"Write the power of $x$ in $T_{r+1}$ as a linear function of $r$, solve, check $r$ is an integer in $[0,n]$. With a polynomial multiplier $(1+2x-3x^3)(\\ldots)^9$, add contributions for each multiplier term.","p":"14 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 44 times"},{"q":"If it asks the coefficient in a product of expansions","f":"[x^k]\\,(A(x)B(x))=\\sum_ra_rb_{k-r}","n":"Simplify first: $(1+x)(1-x)^{10}(1+x+x^2)^9=(1-x)(1-x^3)^9\\cdot\\ldots$; $(1-x)^{101}(1+x+x^2)^{100}=(1-x)(1-x^3)^{100}$.","p":"5 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 15 times"},{"q":"If coefficients of consecutive terms are in a ratio / AP / GP","f":"\\frac{{}^nC_r}{{}^nC_{r-1}}=\\frac{n-r+1}r","n":"Two ratios ⇒ two linear equations in $n$ and $r$. AP: $2\\,{}^nC_r={}^nC_{r-1}+{}^nC_{r+1}$.","p":"8 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 17 times"},{"q":"If it counts rational/integral terms in $(a^{1/p}+b^{1/q})^n$","f":"\\text{need } p\\mid(n-r)\\ \\text{and } q\\mid r\\ \\Rightarrow\\ r \\text{ in an AP; count it}","n":"Irrational terms $=(n+1)-$rational terms.","p":"5 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 11 times"},{"q":"If it compares $k$-th term from the start and from the end","f":"T_k\\ \\text{from end of }(a+b)^n=T_k\\ \\text{of }(b+a)^n","p":"2 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 4 times"},{"q":"If it asks the greatest term or the maximum of the constant term over a parameter","f":"\\frac{T_{r+1}}{T_r}\\ge1;\\ \\ \\text{constant term as function of } x\\ \\text{or } \\theta\\ \\text{then maximise}","p":"5 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 6 times"},{"q":"If it uses sums of coefficients","f":"\\text{put } x=1,\\ -1,\\ \\omega,\\ i;\\ \\ \\text{mean of coefficients}=\\frac{2^n}{n+1}","p":"5 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 7 times"},{"q":"If it gives terms $T_2,T_3,T_4$ numerically","f":"\\frac{T_{r+1}}{T_r}=\\frac{n-r+1}r\\cdot\\frac yx","p":"1 PYQ (2019–2026) · asked 1 time"}]]]}